# Synthetic document D07 for the sustained-extendability test (see EXTENDABILITY.md).
# No real people, organisations or programmes. One file = one document = one named graph.

@prefix :     <https://github.com/luay9/meeting-mandate#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix obo:  <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/> .
@prefix cco:  <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

#################################################################
#  Relation declarations (the same block in every file; see BUILD.md)
#################################################################

obo:BFO_0000055 a owl:ObjectProperty .   # realizes
obo:BFO_0000057 a owl:ObjectProperty .   # has participant
obo:BFO_0000063 a owl:ObjectProperty .   # precedes
obo:BFO_0000101 a owl:ObjectProperty .   # is carrier of
obo:BFO_0000115 a owl:ObjectProperty .   # has member part
obo:BFO_0000117 a owl:ObjectProperty .   # has occurrent part
obo:BFO_0000132 a owl:ObjectProperty .   # occurrent part of
obo:BFO_0000178 a owl:ObjectProperty .   # has continuant part
obo:BFO_0000196 a owl:ObjectProperty .   # bearer of
cco:ont00001833 a owl:ObjectProperty .   # has agent
cco:ont00001986 a owl:ObjectProperty .   # has output
cco:ont00001816 a owl:ObjectProperty .   # is output of
cco:ont00001942 a owl:ObjectProperty .   # prescribes
cco:ont00001916 a owl:ObjectProperty .   # designates
skos:altLabel   a owl:AnnotationProperty .
skos:prefLabel  a owl:AnnotationProperty .
skos:scopeNote  a owl:AnnotationProperty .

<https://github.com/luay9/meeting-mandate/graph/D07> a owl:Ontology ;
    dcterms:title "D07: status note that conflicts with the base"@en ;
    dcterms:date "2026-03-20" ;
    dcterms:description "A deliberately bad document. It says M06 v1.1 is the work itself (a planned act), not the regulation that prescribes it. A mandate is a continuant and a planned act is an occurrent, and BFO makes the two disjoint, so HermiT must reject this document and the base must stay as it was after D06."@en .

# The modelling error the loop has to catch: the mandate is confused with
# the task it requires. Process Regulation is a generically dependent
# continuant; Planned Act is a process; BFO: continuant disjointWith occurrent.
:m06_v1_1 a cco:ont00000228 .                            # Planned Act (wrong)
